				 <i><span class="en">
					Pempel.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.25.52
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾱσάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
					6.5
