			, <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, and poet. (used by <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>, v. infr.), <i>get, acquire</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾱσάμενος ἐπίτασσε</span>, i.e. order your
			own slaves, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i> l.c.: chiefly used in pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπᾱμαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέκτημαι</span>
