				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.3.18
				</span></i>
			; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					13.7
				</span></i>
